@startuml FLOW-04a-双端同步一致性简图
' 课堂汇报拆分图，来源：../FLOW-04-双端阅读进度与笔记同步时序图.puml
title 双端同步一致性主流程
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
autonumber

participant "Android" as A
participant "身份与同步单元" as S
database "PostgreSQL\n当前态 + 变更流" as DB
participant "Windows" as W

A -> A : 本地写入 SyncOperation\noperationId + baseRevision
A -> S : push(operations, cursor)
S -> DB : 单事务校验、更新当前态、追加变更流
DB --> S : revision + 幂等结果
S --> A : ack + nextCursor

W -> S : pull(cursor)
S -> DB : 查询账号级增量变更
DB --> S : changes + tombstone
S --> W : 增量结果 + nextCursor
W -> W : 合并进度；笔记冲突保留副本

alt cursor 已过期
  S --> W : REBASE_REQUIRED
  W -> W : 重新基线，同时保留未确认本地修改
end
@enduml
